ombraUI Core 1.0 "blossomtree"
===========
![Beta banner](https://github.com/ombraUI-core/android_manifest/blob/lineage-22.2/assets/banner.png)

⚠️ WARNING - READ THIS
---------------
ombraUI is still in its INITIAL STAGE so don't expect many features such as Custom apps, don't start dramas and don't act like a 8yo

⚒️ GETTING STARTED
---------------

To get started with Android/ombraUI Core, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the ombraUI trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/ombraUI-core/android_manifest.git -b a15-blossomtree --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync -j(jobs)
```

